// DEFLATE compression for PNG writing: fixed Huffman codes, greedy LZ77 with one candidate per hash (Rust's
// XOR hash `(a<<10 ^ b<<5 ^ c) & 0x7fff`), zlib header `78 01`, adler32; plus crc32. Byte-equal with Rust.
//
// Port of: j3c/src/png.rs (compressor half)
// J3: `j3.gfx.canvas` has a private `deflateFixed` with another hash (other bytes), so the port keeps its own.
// Move to the stdlib once both agree.
module j3c.base.deflate;
